9, 2026</span></span></p><h1 class="post__title" data-v-e79ea0f6>Evri Recognised in Top 5% of Companies Globally for Sustainability Performance</h1></header><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/addfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition2ab4.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/addfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1667%2C1667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/addfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1667%2C1667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/addfUZ1ZCF7ETAYG_HERMESPARCELNETLTD-GROUP-_EV_Recognition.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1667%2C1667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Image of EcoVadis Gold badge" width="960" height="960" class="post__featured-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e79ea0f6><section class="post__content" data-v-e79ea0f6><div data-v-e79ea0f6><!--[--><section id="evri,-the-uk’s-premier-parcel-delivery-company,-has-been-awarded-gold-status-by-independent-global-sustainability-ratings-provider-ecovadis,-placing-the-business-in-the-top-5%-of-companies-assessed-worldwide-for-sustainability-performance." class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri, the UK’s premier parcel delivery company, has been awarded <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Gold<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> status by independent global sustainability ratings provider EcoVadis, placing the business in the <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->top 5% of companies assessed worldwide<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for sustainability performance.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The Gold rating marks a significant step forward for Evri, and following its previous Silver accreditation, recognises continued progress across key environmental, social and ethical areas of the business.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->EcoVadis assesses organisations on the quality of their sustainability performance and management practices across four core themes – Environment, Labour &amp; Human Rights, Ethics, and Sustainable Procurement, with ratings based on evidence-led analysis of policies, actions and results, and benchmarked against companies globally.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri’s Gold EcoVadis accreditation further reinforces its commitment to becoming net zero, reflecting year‑on‑year improvements in its sustainability performance.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Recent progress recognised within the assessment includes the strengthening of Evri’s environmental policy to introduce clearer commitments and targets, as well as the launch of a supplier code of conduct to further embed responsible and ethical practices across its supply chain.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The accreditation also follows Evri’s recent participation in the United Nations Global Compact, the world’s largest voluntary corporate sustainability initiative, reflecting the commitment of CEO Martijn de Lange and the wider business to uphold its principles and drive meaningful impact.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Established by the United Nations in 2000, the UN Global Compact is founded on ten universally accepted principles covering human rights, labour, the environment, and anti‑corruption, and calls on participating organisations to align their strategies and operations with these values.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><figure id="we’re-thrilled-to-be-awarded-gold-status-by-ecovadis-in-recognition-of-the-huge-steps-we’re-making-towards-evri’s-sustainability-goals.-placing-us-in-the-top-5%-of-companies-globally-for-our-sustainability-performance,-this-accreditation-reflects-the-important-progress-taking-place-across-our-operations-and-supply-chain,-and-our-commitment-to-building-a-more-sustainable-and-responsible-parcel-delivery-network." class="quote" index="1" data-v-8c8b68f6><blockquote class="quote__content" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>We’re thrilled to be awarded Gold status by EcoVadis in recognition of the huge steps we’re making towards Evri’s sustainability goals.
Placing us in the top 5% of companies globally for our sustainability performance, this accreditation reflects the important progress taking place across our operations and supply chain, and our commitment to building a more sustainable and responsible parcel delivery network.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="quote__source" data-v-8c8b68f6><p data-v-8c8b68f6>Martijn de Lange, CEO at Evri</p></figcaption></figure><section id="rich_text" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="2" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ENDS<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Notes to editor<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Imagery: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/zwj5yAqmHBACBoqv9" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->https://photos.app.goo.gl/zwj5yAqmHBACBoqv9<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Media enquiries  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:prteam@evri.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->prteam@evri.com<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->About Evri  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000+ couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri has 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6/5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For more info: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.evri.com/news-and-corporate__;!!KZXpRQ!XXp1b6auPQhqEikzO24Td1WLLcOiKei-_sEGnaz1LXy6FIZdIH744ZKALMLghNBHhvufy1YVkeCCqssIjm9R-A$" rel="noreferrer" target=